  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.7.0 introduces scan-ahead row batches for the CSV span readers (UTF-8 and UTF-16), an inline quoted-chunk fast path and a UTF-16 pack-and-saturate front end. Fixes MaxFieldSize enforcement inside the SIMD block path and SourceLineNumber attribution before multi-line quoted fields. Full changelog: https://github.com/KoalaFacts/HeroParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
